## Summary

"Operation Hollow Trust" is the informal name given to what is now understood to be a **coordinated, multi-stage infiltration plan** executed by Undex over approximately six weeks. Rather than acting impulsively, Undex deliberately rebuilt their reputation within Federal Gamers following their 2024 blacklist, secured a second chance, re-earned a mod role — and then systematically exploited every access point available to them.

Incidents I007 through I012 are all considered components of this operation. It is believed Undex planned the operation in coordination with at least two external actors, one of whom was a member of Fish Gang.

---

## Phases

### Phase 1 — Re-entry (Weeks 1–2)
Undex appealed their blacklist with a convincing apology, citing personal growth and expressing genuine-seeming remorse. Leadership voted to give them a watchlist status. Undex was quiet, helpful, and well-behaved during this period.

### Phase 2 — Trust Building (Weeks 3–4)
Undex began actively contributing to the server — helping new members, assisting with events, and volunteering for moderation tasks. This behaviour was noted positively by multiple staff members and contributed to the decision to restore a limited mod role.

### Phase 3 — Access Exploitation (Weeks 4–5)
With mod access restored and trust at a high, Undex began executing. The fake bot (I007) was deployed first as it required the least direct confrontation. VC recording (I008) was conducted simultaneously. Harassment (I009) began after a minor trigger event.

### Phase 4 — Escalation (Week 6)
The doxx threat (I010), raid coordination (I011), and grooming behaviour (I012) all occurred within a 9-day window, suggesting either a loss of patience or a deliberate final push before anticipated removal.

### Phase 5 — Collapse
Undex was permanently blacklisted following the confirmation of I012. The operation collapsed entirely within 48 hours of the first report reaching leadership.

---

## Key Takeaways

- Undex demonstrated sustained capacity for deceptive long-term planning
- The operation revealed gaps in FG's vetting process for role reinstatement
- Trust restoration procedures have since been revised to include a longer probationary period and restricted access tiers

